OL,3,GNEWSA'Nobody knew Isla was dying, now
OL,4,Ashe might change that for others'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of a teenage girl who died
OL,7,Ffrom breast cancer say she would be
OL,8,Fproud her name is being used in a
OL,9,Fscheme which might save the lives of
OL,10,Fother young people.
OL,12,FIsla Sneddon, from Airdrie in North
OL,13,FLanarkshire, died in March 2025 at just
OL,14,F17 years old.
OL,16,FHer parents say doctors dismissed her
OL,17,Fsymptoms as anxiety or hormone changes
OL,18,Fbecause of her age, meaning her cancer
OL,19,Fwent undetected until it was too late.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
