OL,3,GNEWSA'Nobody knew Isla was dying, now
OL,4,Ashe might change that for others'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow her name has been adopted in a set
OL,7,Fof national guidelines for medics
OL,8,Ftreating young patients.
